{
  "title": "LG WebOS Antigo (Colorido)",
  "parent": "tv_lg",
  "description": "Veja como instalar os aplicativos recomendados diretamente na loja oficial da sua LG.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10'><div class='bg-blue-600/10 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-tv'></i> Menu de Barras Coloridas</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>Identificado pela barra de ícones coloridos que aparece na parte inferior da tela ao apertar 'Home'.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/40'>1</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-blue-500/30 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl group hover:bg-[#252b36] transition-all'><div class='flex items-center gap-4 mb-4'><div class='w-16 h-16 bg-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 border border-gray-800 group-hover:bg-blue-600 transition-all shrink-0'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-toptv.png' class='w-full h-full object-contain' onerror=\"this.src='/shared_assets/logo/icone.avif'\"></div><div><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight'>TOPTV App</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-blue-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest'>Recomendação Oficial</p></div></div><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Nosso aplicativo principal e mais estável. Possui suporte a canais 4K e <b>não possui custos de ativação</b>. Pesquise por <strong class='text-white'>'TOPTV'</strong> ou <strong class='text-white'>'HD PLAYER'</strong> na LG Content Store.</p></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg shadow-indigo-900/40'>2</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl group hover:bg-[#252b36] transition-all'><div class='flex items-center gap-4 mb-4'><div class='w-16 h-16 bg-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 border border-gray-800 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 transition-all shrink-0'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-hd-player.png' class='w-full h-full object-contain'></div><div><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight'>HD Player</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-indigo-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest'>Interface Moderna</p></div></div><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed'>Visual elegante estilo Netflix e troca de canais rápida. Também é <b>totalmente gratuito</b> para nossos parceiros. Busque pelo ícone azul com nome <strong class='text-white'>'HD Player'</strong>.</p></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-amber-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg shadow-amber-900/40'>3</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl group hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-all'><div class='flex items-center gap-4 mb-4'><div class='w-16 h-16 bg-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 border border-gray-800 group-hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all shrink-0'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-clouddy.webp' class='w-full h-full object-contain'></div><div><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight'>ClouDDy</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-amber-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest'>Estabilidade Máxima</p></div></div><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4'>O player mais robusto que existe. Indicado quando os apps acima não estão disponíveis na sua loja.</p><div class='bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 p-4 rounded-2xl'><p class='text-[9px] text-amber-200 font-bold uppercase mb-1'><i class='fas fa-info-circle'></i> Nota Importante:</p><p class='text-[9px] text-gray-400'>Este aplicativo é pago à parte diretamente ao desenvolvedor. Oferece 7 dias de teste gratuito.</p></div></div></section><div class='bg-amber-600/10 border-l-4 border-amber-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mt-10'><div class='flex items-center gap-4'><div class='w-12 h-12 bg-amber-600/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-amber-500 shrink-0'><i class='fas fa-triangle-exclamation'></i></div><div><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase text-xs tracking-widest'>Não encontrou nenhum destes?</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1'>Se a loja da sua LG estiver muito limitada, utilize o método de <b>Configuração via DNS</b>.</p></div></div><button onclick=\"navigateTo('dns', 'Configuração via DNS')\" class='w-full mt-6 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black py-4 rounded-2xl text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-amber-500 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-amber-900/20'>Ver Passo a Passo do DNS</button></div></div>"
  }
}
